  "description": {
    "text": "The first promo card pack of the MEGA era in Korea, the Korean counterpart of the Pokémon Card Gym Promo Card Pack 1, which began the M-P promos on 26 September 2025 with 001/M-P Chikorita. Its cards are 001/M-P to 007/M-P: Chikorita, Lapras ex, Munkidori, Makuhita, Hole-Digging Shovel, Counter Gain and Lillie's Determination. Promo card packs were prizes at Pokémon Card Shop events, such as the MEGA Brave and MEGA Symphonia release tournaments from 27 September 2025, where every player got one pack."
  },
